    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="21">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 21</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Be ðeofan. We wyllað þæt ælc man ofer twelfwintre sylle þone að, þæt he nyle ðeof beon ne ðeofes gewita.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Concerning thieves. It is our desire that everyone, over twelve years of age, shall take an oath that he will not be a thief or a thief's accomplice.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ac we wyllað, þæt ælc man ofer XIIwintre sylle þone að, þæt he nelle þeof beon ne þeofes gewita.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
